  "duration_s": 104.279002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "小王，今天让你破费了，领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理呀。怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了不喝，就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病，来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。领导饭在哪儿？我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气吗？小王啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走，哪不还是得听领导指挥吗？小王啊，你这点点演的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您好，哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。哈哈哈，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。哈哈哈哈，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1070,
      "end_ms": 2190,
      "text": "今天让你破费了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2430,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00004",
      "start_ms": 2870,
      "end_ms": 4250,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4250,
      "end_ms": 5010,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00006",
      "start_ms": 5230,
      "end_ms": 7050,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00007",
      "start_ms": 7050,
      "end_ms": 10810,
      "text": "不是来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 12010,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12030,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13030,
      "end_ms": 13450,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13730,
      "end_ms": 14350,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00012",
      "start_ms": 14350,
      "end_ms": 15010,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00013",
      "start_ms": 15110,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00014",
      "start_ms": 16890,
      "end_ms": 19250,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00015",
      "start_ms": 20150,
      "end_ms": 21170,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00016",
      "start_ms": 21230,
      "end_ms": 22590,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00017",
      "start_ms": 22670,
      "end_ms": 23610,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00018",
      "start_ms": 23670,
      "end_ms": 25230,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00019",
      "start_ms": 25430,
      "end_ms": 29430,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了不喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00020",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 31120,
      "text": "就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00021",
      "start_ms": 31600,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00022",
      "start_ms": 32100,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00023",
      "start_ms": 33280,
      "end_ms": 34240,
      "text": "我是看不起病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39240,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00025",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 42840,
      "text": "领导饭在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00026",
      "start_ms": 42840,
      "end_ms": 43560,
      "text": "我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00027",
      "start_ms": 43560,
      "end_ms": 45520,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00028",
      "start_ms": 45520,
      "end_ms": 49480,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00029",
      "start_ms": 49480,
      "end_ms": 50700,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00030",
      "start_ms": 50700,
      "end_ms": 52200,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00031",
      "start_ms": 52200,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00032",
      "start_ms": 53360,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00033",
      "start_ms": 55420,
      "end_ms": 57040,
      "text": "哪不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00034",
      "start_ms": 58520,
      "end_ms": 59440,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00035",
      "start_ms": 59440,
      "end_ms": 60945,
      "text": "你这点点演的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61200,
      "end_ms": 62810,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00037",
      "start_ms": 62850,
      "end_ms": 64490,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00038",
      "start_ms": 64490,
      "end_ms": 65460,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00039",
      "start_ms": 65460,
      "end_ms": 67930,
      "text": "我先敬您好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00040",
      "start_ms": 68560,
      "end_ms": 68875,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00041",
      "start_ms": 69370,
      "end_ms": 70215,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00042",
      "start_ms": 70480,
      "end_ms": 71865,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00043",
      "start_ms": 72100,
      "end_ms": 72880,
      "text": "领导美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00044",
      "start_ms": 72880,
      "end_ms": 73280,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00045",
      "start_ms": 73380,
      "end_ms": 74400,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00046",
      "start_ms": 74520,
      "end_ms": 76335,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00047",
      "start_ms": 77520,
      "end_ms": 78135,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00048",
      "start_ms": 78660,
      "end_ms": 80125,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00049",
      "start_ms": 80730,
      "end_ms": 82245,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00050",
      "start_ms": 82590,
      "end_ms": 83690,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00051",
      "start_ms": 83890,
      "end_ms": 85205,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00052",
      "start_ms": 85960,
      "end_ms": 86695,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00053",
      "start_ms": 88750,
      "end_ms": 89955,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00054",
      "start_ms": 90480,
      "end_ms": 92440,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00055",
      "start_ms": 92440,
      "end_ms": 94545,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00056",
      "start_ms": 96820,
      "end_ms": 98155,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00057",
      "start_ms": 98690,
      "end_ms": 99325,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00058",
      "start_ms": 99660,
      "end_ms": 101140,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00059",
      "start_ms": 101160,
      "end_ms": 101900,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fe68dbaa6d9e6330_s00060",
      "start_ms": 102200,
      "end_ms": 104035,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
